{"about_the_game":"Slime Nomi is a pixelated platformer. Help Nomi collect potion ingredients with the help of unique mechanics in various hand-crafted levels.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/\u53f2\u83b1\u59c6\u65b0\u5c01\u9762_\u5de6\u4e0a\u89d2.gif?t=1738077217\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Minor_Starflower_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />A variety of unique mechanics<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Minor_Starflower_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Over ten original mechanics! Each chapter brings a whole new experience to the player. Teleport potions, bubble gums, wisps that can pass through walls, shields, explosive bricks... the game is loaded with creative ideas.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Pufferfish_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Varied level design<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Pufferfish_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Hundreds of well-designed levels blending different mechanics. Each level has a different route and experience.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Colorful_Star_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Cute pixel art<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Colorful_Star_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Smooth pixel art animations and widely different scenes.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Green_Bubble_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Story mode with moderate difficulty<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Green_Bubble_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Difficulty of story mode increases gradually and slowly.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Single_Jelly_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Map and collectible marks<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Single_Jelly_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Level map can be unlocked early in story mode. The map has marks of savepoints and collectibles, making it easier to explore and collect things.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Pink_Wisp_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Custom options<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Pink_Wisp_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Provide help to beat challenging levels.<br></li><li><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Yellow_Potion_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />Extra levels<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/Yellow_Potion_Idle.gif?t=1738077217\" />: Extra levels have Innovative ideas that are not in the main game. Piano music mix platforming, match-three mix platforming... brilliant ideas everywhere!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934150?t=1738077217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738077217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/968e1b207f8a88eaa60505e4f3803947562880df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738077217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a